# Xiaomi MiMo Open Platform — session cookie
#
# How to get it:
#   1. Log into https://platform.xiaomimimo.com in your browser
#   2. Open DevTools (F12) → Network tab
#   3. Click any API request → Headers → Request Headers
#   4. Copy the full value of the `Cookie` header
#
# Then either:
#   - export MIMO_COOKIE='...'  in your shell, or
#   - copy this file to .env and fill it in, or
#   - pass --cookie '...' on the command line
MIMO_COOKIE=
